    "detailed_description": "Take possession of an over-armed spaceship to succeed in the Space Show challenges!<br>3 brands of equipment with very different philosophies:<br><strong>Falcon industrie</strong>: agility and responsiveness<br><strong>Wolf Tech</strong>: the most advanced technology for combat use<br><strong>Rhino Corp</strong>: raw power.<br><br>Equip your ship with <strong>5 of the 45 weapons available</strong> (Blaster, Rocket, Plasma, Electric...) customize it and adapt your weaponry to the situation.<br><br>During challenges, you'll have to attack enemy ships, withstand meteor showers, defend planet Earth by developing its passive defenses... And many more surprises await you.<br><br><i>The year is 2085, the year of the 17th Space Show. <br>It's the most watched reality show in the solar system: 32 billion viewers! The concept is simple: 13 million contestants compete against each other. Their agility, fighting skills and ability to implement an effective strategy will make the difference.<br><br>The winner will receive a &quot;molecular reconstruction chip&quot; giving him/her access to immortality.</i>",
    "about_the_game": "Take possession of an over-armed spaceship to succeed in the Space Show challenges!<br>3 brands of equipment with very different philosophies:<br><strong>Falcon industrie</strong>: agility and responsiveness<br><strong>Wolf Tech</strong>: the most advanced technology for combat use<br><strong>Rhino Corp</strong>: raw power.<br><br>Equip your ship with <strong>5 of the 45 weapons available</strong> (Blaster, Rocket, Plasma, Electric...) customize it and adapt your weaponry to the situation.<br><br>During challenges, you'll have to attack enemy ships, withstand meteor showers, defend planet Earth by developing its passive defenses... And many more surprises await you.<br><br><i>The year is 2085, the year of the 17th Space Show. <br>It's the most watched reality show in the solar system: 32 billion viewers! The concept is simple: 13 million contestants compete against each other. Their agility, fighting skills and ability to implement an effective strategy will make the difference.<br><br>The winner will receive a &quot;molecular reconstruction chip&quot; giving him/her access to immortality.</i>",
    "short_description": "Nervous, dynamic space shooter. Pass all the tests and become THE BEST.",
